[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7860.069, "timestamp": "02:11:00", "text": "不，不，她把整个东西都下载了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7865.83, "timestamp": "02:11:05", "text": "大概不到一周吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7867.83, "timestamp": "02:11:07", "text": "但问题是，即使它说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7870.55, "timestamp": "02:11:10", "text": "它是无限的，不是。是的，不是这样的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7874.87, "timestamp": "02:11:14", "text": "最终的。我知道。是B。我不得不战斗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7878.709, "timestamp": "02:11:18", "text": "这个月两次了，兄弟。因为我就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7881.03, "timestamp": "02:11:21", "text": "下载和上传 V 不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7884.87, "timestamp": "02:11:24", "text": "相信。我心想，天哪，这太痛苦了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7886.87, "timestamp": "02:11:26", "text": "为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7890.43, "timestamp": "02:11:30", "text": "就像我的网络供应商讨厌的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7893.27, "timestamp": "02:11:33", "text": "我。他有时就像我会称之为“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7894.629, "timestamp": "02:11:34", "text": "就像，“哦，又是你啊。”我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7897.189, "timestamp": "02:11:37", "text": "“他妈的，你为什么认识我？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7903.27, "timestamp": "02:11:43", "text": "等等，你为什么把互联网叫做互联网？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7905.91, "timestamp": "02:11:45", "text": "提供商？就像我有时也会那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7907.589, "timestamp": "02:11:47", "text": "打电话投诉网络问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7909.83, "timestamp": "02:11:49", "text": "慢的时候我会告诉他们，其他时候我会慢慢地告诉他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7911.669, "timestamp": "02:11:51", "text": "好吧，那计划是什么？是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7914.149, "timestamp": "02:11:54", "text": "就像我能得到我无法得到的东西一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7915.43, "timestamp": "02:11:55", "text": "有时候我打电话给他们只是为了……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7918.55, "timestamp": "02:11:58", "text": "看看他们做得怎么样。啊，"}]